From 3a97b432dbd1212eb285adedd4e6610e28c1c351 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:40:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Live options: gate on driver support, only send changed
 keys; keep eye page state

- The restart banner is skipped for live options only when the running
  driver reports live_settings in its status file.
- The live settings file carries only live keys changed in Envision since
  the service started, so values from launch options or elsewhere stay.
- Uses the same profile choice as the service start.
- Preferences close: restart banner only for what the dialog changed.
- The eye page is rebuilt after a running tool finishes; its result message
  and fit error survive the rebuild. Clearer "applies immediately" texts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
